{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54043","headline":"王子颂五首 末生 · 良价","name":"王子颂五首 末生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久栖岩岳（《五灯会元》作「壑」）用功夫，草榻柴扉守志孤。\n十载见闻心自委，一身冬夏衣缣无。\n澄凝愁看（《五灯会元》作「含笑」，《禅门诸祖师偈颂》作「愁笑」）三愁思，情苦高名上哲图。\n业就巍（《五灯会元》作「高」，《禅门诸祖师偈颂》作「帝」）科酬极志（《五灯会元》作「志极」），比来臣相不当途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54043.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54043","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}